Description: small, crash-safe SQL database with an HTTP API
 ZikriyonDB stores data in a single file with a write-ahead log, speaks SQL
 (joins, indexes, transactions, row-level security) and serves a JSON HTTP API
 that web pages can call directly. It can publish itself on a public HTTPS
 address through an outbound tunnel, so it also runs on phones and small
 devices behind a router.
